### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### ROLES API (AdminOnly)
### ============================================================

### List all roles — paged + search (QUERY — new)
QUERY {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "searchTerm": "Admin",
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 20
}

### Get role by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "roleName": "Editor",
  "level": 40,
  "parentRoleId": null
}

### Create a role with parent (hierarchy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "roleName": "SeniorEditor",
  "level": 60,
  "parentRoleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

### Update a role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "roleName": "Senior Editor",
  "level": 60,
  "parentRoleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

### Delete a role (soft-delete → IsActive=false)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Activate a deactivated role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/activate
Cookie: {{token}}
